{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "网关 → Nexent 北向 POST /nb/v1/chat/run 的请求体（v2.8.2 探针实测字段）。\n\ntool_params 形如 {\"agents\": {agent: {\"tools\": {tool: {param: value}}}}}，只给白名单工具注入 ctx，\n知识库检索工具注入 document_paths。这是唯一允许携带注入值的契约，只在网关进程内构造、不落日志。\nrepr/str 与校验报错已脱敏；model_dump 仍含原值（发给 Nexent 需要），只能在出站请求处调用。",
  "properties": {
    "agent_name": {
      "maxLength": 200,
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Agent Name",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "query": {
      "minLength": 1,
      "title": "Query",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "conversation_id": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Conversation Id"
    },
    "tool_params": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "additionalProperties": {
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "type": "object"
              },
              "type": "object"
            },
            "type": "object"
          },
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Tool Params"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "agent_name",
    "query"
  ],
  "title": "NexentRunPayload",
  "type": "object",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "plantkg:contracts/1.2.0/NexentRunPayload"
}
